{
  "voice": "ja-JP-NanamiNeural",
  "sourcePath": "C:\\Users\\admin\\Downloads\\sanma_tran_thanh_furigana_katakana_hiragana_UPDATED(2).html",
  "finalPath": "C:\\Users\\admin\\Downloads\\fukui_yuki_expressive_nanami.mp3",
  "clips": [
    {
      "text": "なぜ雪に興味があるのか。",
      "kind": "title",
      "slide": 1,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-7%",
      "pitch": "+2Hz",
      "pause": "long",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-001.mp3",
      "duration": 3.24
    },
    {
      "text": "皆さん、こんにちは。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 1,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-002.mp3",
      "duration": 2.688
    },
    {
      "text": "今日は、福井県の冬の観光地についてお話しします。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 1,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-003.mp3",
      "duration": 5.376
    },
    {
      "text": "実は、私、まだ一度も本物の雪を見たことがないんです。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 1,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-5%",
      "pitch": "+1Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-004.mp3",
      "duration": 6.144
    },
    {
      "text": "映画や写真ではよく見ますが、実際の雪を想像すると、なぜか冷凍庫の内側にできる白い霜を思い出します。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 1,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-005.mp3",
      "duration": 9.912
    },
    {
      "text": "あの、白くてふわっとした霜です。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 1,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-2%",
      "pitch": "+3Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-006.mp3",
      "duration": 3.624
    },
    {
      "text": "見た目は少し似ていますよね。でも、本物の雪は触ったらどんな感じなんでしょうか。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 1,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-6%",
      "pitch": "+5Hz",
      "pause": "medium",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-007.mp3",
      "duration": 8.232
    },
    {
      "text": "調べてみると、雪は氷の結晶でできているそうですが、写真で見ているだけでは、実際の感触までは分かりません。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 1,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-008.mp3",
      "duration": 10.104
    },
    {
      "text": "だったら、一度自分で触って確かめてみたいです。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 1,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-009.mp3",
      "duration": 4.704
    },
    {
      "text": "そう思って、今回は福井県で雪を楽しめる場所を探してみました。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 1,
      "isSlideEnd": true,
      "rate": "-2%",
      "pitch": "+3Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-010.mp3",
      "duration": 6.336
    },
    {
      "text": "なぜ福井県を選んだのか。",
      "kind": "title",
      "slide": 2,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-7%",
      "pitch": "+2Hz",
      "pause": "long",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-011.mp3",
      "duration": 3.144
    },
    {
      "text": "日本で雪といえば、最初に思い浮かぶのは北海道です。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 2,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-012.mp3",
      "duration": 5.52
    },
    {
      "text": "私も最初は、雪を見るなら北海道に行ってみたいと考えていました。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 2,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-2%",
      "pitch": "+3Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-013.mp3",
      "duration": 6.216
    },
    {
      "text": "でも、来年から福井県で働く予定なので、まずは福井の周辺で行ける場所を探してみました。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 2,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-5%",
      "pitch": "+1Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-014.mp3",
      "duration": 8.568
    },
    {
      "text": "すると、勝山市に大きなスキー場があることを知りました。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 2,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-015.mp3",
      "duration": 5.4
    },
    {
      "text": "それが「JAM福井勝山マウンテンリゾート」です。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 2,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-016.mp3",
      "duration": 4.704
    },
    {
      "text": "以前は「スキージャム勝山」という名前で知られていた場所です。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 2,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-017.mp3",
      "duration": 5.64
    },
    {
      "text": "北海道にもいつか行ってみたいですが、福井に住むようになれば、ここなら休日にも行けそうです。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 2,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-2%",
      "pitch": "+3Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-018.mp3",
      "duration": 7.848
    },
    {
      "text": "それに、せっかく福井で生活するので、近くにどんな面白い場所があるのか、少しずつ知っていきたいです。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 2,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-2%",
      "pitch": "+3Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-019.mp3",
      "duration": 8.928
    },
    {
      "text": "今回は、このリゾートを目的地にして、日帰りで行くことを考えてみました。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 2,
      "isSlideEnd": true,
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-020.mp3",
      "duration": 6.768
    },
    {
      "text": "JAM福井勝山には何がある？",
      "kind": "title",
      "slide": 3,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-7%",
      "pitch": "+2Hz",
      "pause": "long",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-021.mp3",
      "duration": 3.432
    },
    {
      "text": "まず、JAM福井勝山がどんな場所なのか紹介します。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 3,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-022.mp3",
      "duration": 5.328
    },
    {
      "text": "ここは、初心者から上級者まで楽しめる大きなスキーリゾートです。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 3,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-2%",
      "pitch": "+3Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-023.mp3",
      "duration": 6.072
    },
    {
      "text": "いろいろなコースがあって、最長滑走距離は約5.8キロもあります。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 3,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-024.mp3",
      "duration": 6.72
    },
    {
      "text": "5.8キロというと、かなり長いですよね。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 3,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-025.mp3",
      "duration": 4.32
    },
    {
      "text": "そんな距離を滑れるようになるには、相当練習が必要そうです。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 3,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-026.mp3",
      "duration": 5.952
    },
    {
      "text": "もちろん、初心者向けのコースも用意されています。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 3,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-5%",
      "pitch": "+1Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-027.mp3",
      "duration": 4.728
    },
    {
      "text": "それから、スキー以外の楽しみ方もあります。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 3,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-2%",
      "pitch": "+3Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-028.mp3",
      "duration": 4.2
    },
    {
      "text": "その一つが「JAMMIDBASE」です。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 3,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-029.mp3",
      "duration": 3.816
    },
    {
      "text": "ここは標高約1,000メートルにあるエリアで、スキーをしない人でもリフトに乗って行くことができます。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 3,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-030.mp3",
      "duration": 8.112
    },
    {
      "text": "そこからは、雪に覆われた山々や勝山市街の景色を見渡せるそうです。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 3,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-031.mp3",
      "duration": 7.176
    },
    {
      "text": "私は特に、この景色を自分の目で見てみたいです。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 3,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-2%",
      "pitch": "+3Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-032.mp3",
      "duration": 5.064
    },
    {
      "text": "そして、もう一つ面白そうだったのが「スノーラフティング」です。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 3,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-2%",
      "pitch": "+3Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-033.mp3",
      "duration": 5.664
    },
    {
      "text": "これは、スノーモービルに引っ張られたボートに乗って、雪の上を走るアクティビティです。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 3,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-034.mp3",
      "duration": 7.032
    },
    {
      "text": "動画を見たんですが、けっこうスピードがありそうでした。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 3,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-035.mp3",
      "duration": 4.776
    },
    {
      "text": "スキー場というと滑ることが中心だと思っていましたが、ほかにもいろいろな楽しみ方があるんですね。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 3,
      "isSlideEnd": true,
      "rate": "-2%",
      "pitch": "+3Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-036.mp3",
      "duration": 7.992
    },
    {
      "text": "どうやって行く？",
      "kind": "title",
      "slide": 4,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-7%",
      "pitch": "+2Hz",
      "pause": "long",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-037.mp3",
      "duration": 2.088
    },
    {
      "text": "次は、行き方についてです。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 4,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-038.mp3",
      "duration": 3.336
    },
    {
      "text": "今回は、鯖江から出発するルートを調べました。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 4,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-039.mp3",
      "duration": 4.776
    },
    {
      "text": "まず、鯖江駅からハピラインふくいに乗って、福井駅まで行きます。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 4,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-040.mp3",
      "duration": 6.144
    },
    {
      "text": "福井駅で、えちぜん鉄道の勝山永平寺線に乗り換えて、終点の勝山駅まで向かいます。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 4,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-041.mp3",
      "duration": 8.592
    },
    {
      "text": "そして、勝山駅からスキー場の無料シャトルバスを利用します。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 4,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-042.mp3",
      "duration": 5.832
    },
    {
      "text": "ただし、このバスはWEBでの事前予約が必要です。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 4,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-043.mp3",
      "duration": 5.304
    },
    {
      "text": "なので、先にシャトルバスの時刻を確認してから、それに合わせて電車を選ぶのがよさそうです。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 4,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-044.mp3",
      "duration": 8.184
    },
    {
      "text": "特に、帰りのバスも忘れずに予約しておきたいですね。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 4,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-045.mp3",
      "duration": 5.136
    },
    {
      "text": "それから、移動中の景色もちょっと楽しみです。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 4,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-2%",
      "pitch": "+3Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-046.mp3",
      "duration": 4.776
    },
    {
      "text": "電車の窓から、だんだん雪が多くなっていく景色が見られたら、面白そうですよね。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 4,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-2%",
      "pitch": "+3Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-047.mp3",
      "duration": 7.272
    },
    {
      "text": "初めて行く場所なので、乗り換えの時間にも余裕を持っておこうと思います。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 4,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-2%",
      "pitch": "+3Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-048.mp3",
      "duration": 6.288
    },
    {
      "text": "せっかく遊びに行くので、帰りのバスに乗り遅れないようにしたいです。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 4,
      "isSlideEnd": true,
      "rate": "-7%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz",
      "pause": "medium",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-049.mp3",
      "duration": 6.168
    },
    {
      "text": "初めてのスキーに挑戦！",
      "kind": "title",
      "slide": 5,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-7%",
      "pitch": "+2Hz",
      "pause": "long",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-050.mp3",
      "duration": 2.928
    },
    {
      "text": "次は、今回一番挑戦してみたいスキーについてです。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 5,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-2%",
      "pitch": "+3Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-051.mp3",
      "duration": 5.304
    },
    {
      "text": "スキーもスノーボードも面白そうですが、私はまずスキーをやってみたいです。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 5,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-2%",
      "pitch": "+3Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-052.mp3",
      "duration": 6.408
    },
    {
      "text": "調べてみると、スキー板やブーツ、専用のウェアなど、いろいろな道具が必要なんですね。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 5,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-053.mp3",
      "duration": 7.848
    },
    {
      "text": "ただ、JAM福井勝山では道具やウェアをレンタルできるので、最初から全部買う必要はなさそうです。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 5,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-5%",
      "pitch": "+1Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-054.mp3",
      "duration": 8.808
    },
    {
      "text": "初めてなので、レンタルできるのは助かりますね。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 5,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-2%",
      "pitch": "+3Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-055.mp3",
      "duration": 4.44
    },
    {
      "text": "手袋やゴーグルなど、何を自分で準備する必要があるかは、事前に確認しておこうと思います。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 5,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-056.mp3",
      "duration": 8.664
    },
    {
      "text": "それから、初心者向けのスキースクールもあります。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 5,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-057.mp3",
      "duration": 4.416
    },
    {
      "text": "やっぱり最初は、インストラクターに基本から教えてもらいたいです。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 5,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-058.mp3",
      "duration": 5.904
    },
    {
      "text": "特に、まず覚えたいのは止まり方です。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 5,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-059.mp3",
      "duration": 4.152
    },
    {
      "text": "滑ることができても、止まれなかったら危ないですからね。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 5,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-7%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz",
      "pause": "medium",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-060.mp3",
      "duration": 5.136
    },
    {
      "text": "なので、最初から上手に滑ることよりも、安全に止まれるようになることが目標です。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 5,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-7%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz",
      "pause": "medium",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-061.mp3",
      "duration": 7.752
    },
    {
      "text": "もちろん、最初は何回か転ぶかもしれません。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 5,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-5%",
      "pitch": "+1Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-062.mp3",
      "duration": 4.56
    },
    {
      "text": "でも、練習して、自分で短い距離を滑れるようになったら、初日としては十分だと思います。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 5,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-5%",
      "pitch": "+1Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-063.mp3",
      "duration": 8.76
    },
    {
      "text": "実際にやってみたら、動画で見るよりずっと難しいかもしれませんね。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 5,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-064.mp3",
      "duration": 5.976
    },
    {
      "text": "それも含めて、初めてのスキーを楽しんでみたいです。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 5,
      "isSlideEnd": true,
      "rate": "-2%",
      "pitch": "+3Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-065.mp3",
      "duration": 4.968
    },
    {
      "text": "スキー場では何が食べられる？",
      "kind": "title",
      "slide": 6,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-7%",
      "pitch": "+2Hz",
      "pause": "long",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-066.mp3",
      "duration": 3.216
    },
    {
      "text": "それから、食事についても少し調べてみました。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 6,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-067.mp3",
      "duration": 4.92
    },
    {
      "text": "寒いところで体を動かしたあとなら、温かいものが食べたくなりそうですよね。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 6,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-068.mp3",
      "duration": 6.768
    },
    {
      "text": "JAM福井勝山には、食事や休憩ができるレストランがいくつかあります。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 6,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-069.mp3",
      "duration": 6.528
    },
    {
      "text": "その中で気になったのが、JAMMIDBASEにある「ジョイントカフェ」です。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 6,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-070.mp3",
      "duration": 5.904
    },
    {
      "text": "ここでは、ラーメンやカレー、スイーツなどが楽しめるそうです。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 6,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-2%",
      "pitch": "+3Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-071.mp3",
      "duration": 5.424
    },
    {
      "text": "私はラーメンかカレーを食べてみたいです。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 6,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-2%",
      "pitch": "+3Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-072.mp3",
      "duration": 3.816
    },
    {
      "text": "特に、寒い中でスキーの練習をしたあとに食べる温かいラーメンは、おいしそうですね。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 6,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-2%",
      "pitch": "+3Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-073.mp3",
      "duration": 7.512
    },
    {
      "text": "せっかくなら、お昼はこのカフェに行ってみたいです。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 6,
      "isSlideEnd": true,
      "rate": "-2%",
      "pitch": "+3Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-074.mp3",
      "duration": 4.512
    },
    {
      "text": "私の日帰りプラン。",
      "kind": "title",
      "slide": 7,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-7%",
      "pitch": "+2Hz",
      "pause": "long",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-075.mp3",
      "duration": 2.688
    },
    {
      "text": "ここまで調べた情報をもとに、日帰りのプランを考えてみました。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 7,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-076.mp3",
      "duration": 5.976
    },
    {
      "text": "一日で全部のアクティビティを体験するのは難しそうなので、今回はスキーのレッスンを中心に予定を組みました。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 7,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-077.mp3",
      "duration": 9.504
    },
    {
      "text": "まず、午前中です。",
      "kind": "subheading",
      "slide": 7,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-6%",
      "pitch": "+2Hz",
      "pause": "medium",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-078.mp3",
      "duration": 2.784
    },
    {
      "text": "朝は早めに鯖江を出発して、できれば午前中の早い時間にスキー場に着きたいです。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 7,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-079.mp3",
      "duration": 7.872
    },
    {
      "text": "到着したら、少し雪を触ったり、写真を撮ったりする時間を取りたいです。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 7,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-080.mp3",
      "duration": 6.888
    },
    {
      "text": "そのあとは、レンタルの手続きをして、初心者向けのスキーレッスンに参加する予定です。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 7,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-081.mp3",
      "duration": 7.536
    },
    {
      "text": "レッスンの開始時間は決まっているので、そこに間に合うように出発時間を考えておく必要があります。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 7,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-082.mp3",
      "duration": 8.76
    },
    {
      "text": "もし朝のレッスンに間に合わなければ、午後のレッスンにするなど、予定を変えることになると思います。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 7,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-083.mp3",
      "duration": 8.232
    },
    {
      "text": "でも、できれば午前中にレッスンを受けて、午後はほかのことを楽しみたいです。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 7,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-2%",
      "pitch": "+3Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-084.mp3",
      "duration": 6.72
    },
    {
      "text": "次は、お昼です。",
      "kind": "subheading",
      "slide": 7,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-6%",
      "pitch": "+2Hz",
      "pause": "medium",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-085.mp3",
      "duration": 2.568
    },
    {
      "text": "レッスンが終わったら、リフトに乗ってJAMMIDBASEへ向かいます。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 7,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-086.mp3",
      "duration": 5.376
    },
    {
      "text": "お昼は、さっき紹介したジョイントカフェで食べる予定です。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 7,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-087.mp3",
      "duration": 5.328
    },
    {
      "text": "食事をしながら少し休んで、午後はそのままJAMMIDBASEで過ごしたいです。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 7,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-088.mp3",
      "duration": 6.696
    },
    {
      "text": "そして、午後です。",
      "kind": "subheading",
      "slide": 7,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-6%",
      "pitch": "+2Hz",
      "pause": "medium",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-089.mp3",
      "duration": 2.616
    },
    {
      "text": "まずは、山の上から勝山市街や周りの景色を眺めたり、写真を撮ったりしたいです。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 7,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-090.mp3",
      "duration": 7.872
    },
    {
      "text": "天気がよければ、遠くの山まできれいに見えるかもしれませんね。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 7,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-091.mp3",
      "duration": 5.664
    },
    {
      "text": "それから、時間と体力に余裕があれば、スノーラフティングにも挑戦してみたいです。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 7,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-2%",
      "pitch": "+3Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-092.mp3",
      "duration": 7.104
    },
    {
      "text": "ただ、初めてのスキーでどのくらい疲れるのかは、まだ分かりません。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 7,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-2%",
      "pitch": "+3Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-093.mp3",
      "duration": 5.904
    },
    {
      "text": "なので、そのときの体力や時間を見て決めるつもりです。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 7,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-094.mp3",
      "duration": 5.28
    },
    {
      "text": "もし疲れていたら、無理をせずに景色を楽しむだけでもいいと思っています。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 7,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-7%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz",
      "pause": "medium",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-095.mp3",
      "duration": 6.648
    },
    {
      "text": "最後は、帰りです。",
      "kind": "subheading",
      "slide": 7,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-6%",
      "pitch": "+2Hz",
      "pause": "medium",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-096.mp3",
      "duration": 2.496
    },
    {
      "text": "帰りのバスに間に合うように、早めに下のエリアへ戻って、レンタルした道具を返します。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 7,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-097.mp3",
      "duration": 7.992
    },
    {
      "text": "実は、このリゾートには温泉もあります。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 7,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-5%",
      "pitch": "+1Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-098.mp3",
      "duration": 4.296
    },
    {
      "text": "最初は温泉にも行こうかと考えたんですが、今回は日帰りなので、ちょっと時間が足りなさそうです。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 7,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-099.mp3",
      "duration": 8.496
    },
    {
      "text": "温泉はまた別の機会にしようと思っています。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 7,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-100.mp3",
      "duration": 4.56
    },
    {
      "text": "こんな感じで、午前中はスキー、午後はJAMMIDBASEで過ごすプランを考えてみました。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 7,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-101.mp3",
      "duration": 7.872
    },
    {
      "text": "もちろん、実際に行くときは、レッスンやバスの時刻に合わせて調整するつもりです。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 7,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-5%",
      "pitch": "+1Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-102.mp3",
      "duration": 7.368
    },
    {
      "text": "初めて行く場所なので、あまり予定を詰め込みすぎずに、一日を楽しめたらいいですね。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 7,
      "isSlideEnd": true,
      "rate": "-2%",
      "pitch": "+3Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-103.mp3",
      "duration": 7.512
    },
    {
      "text": "まとめ・皆さんへの質問。",
      "kind": "title",
      "slide": 8,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-7%",
      "pitch": "+2Hz",
      "pause": "long",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-104.mp3",
      "duration": 3.336
    },
    {
      "text": "今回調べてみて、JAM福井勝山でどんなことができるのか、だいぶイメージできました。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 8,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-105.mp3",
      "duration": 7.56
    },
    {
      "text": "実際に行ったら、雪の感触も自分で確かめてみたいです。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 8,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-106.mp3",
      "duration": 5.592
    },
    {
      "text": "ちなみに、福井の冬には、ほかにもおすすめの場所や雪の楽しみ方がありますか。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 8,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-6%",
      "pitch": "+5Hz",
      "pause": "medium",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-107.mp3",
      "duration": 7.656
    },
    {
      "text": "もしあれば、ぜひ参考にしたいです。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 8,
      "isSlideEnd": false,
      "rate": "-4%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "pause": "short",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-108.mp3",
      "duration": 3.936
    },
    {
      "text": "聞いてくださって、ありがとうございました。",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "slide": 8,
      "isSlideEnd": true,
      "rate": "-9%",
      "pitch": "+1Hz",
      "pause": "medium",
      "clipPath": "C:\\project\\veiltalk\\.tts_runtime\\fukui_expressive\\part-109.mp3",
      "duration": 4.032
    }
  ]
}